 # Membership summary
 
-(to be completed: notice period and expense approval threshold)
+Members may terminate their membership in writing. The notice period for members is thirty (30) days, counted from the day the written notice is received [[cite:obs-3cd08a4830e7d1f75741653499c43d97807fa426 "Members may terminate their membership in writing. The notice period for members is
+thirty (30) days, counted from the day the written notice is received."]].
+
+With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense. Expenses above the threshold need written approval by the treasurer before they are incurred [[cite:obs-21b93f0bd182da74b1b4b78cda2e87963fce05ae "With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per
+single expense. Expenses above the threshold need written approval by the treasurer
+before they are incurred."]].
